# FAIL CLOSED. Ignore everything, then allow only what is safe on GitHub.
# Plaintext evidence and notes stay on JENNY. GitHub gets sealed/*.gpg only.
# Adding a line below means that file goes to GitHub UNENCRYPTED. Ask Mike first.
*
!*/
!/.gitignore
!/.gitattributes
!/README.md
!/SHA256SUMS
!/tools/
!/tools/**
!/sealed/
!/sealed/**
# Never commit these, even inside allowed folders
*.key
.~lock.*
__pycache__/
